title: $:/mf/gen/Panel/viewer panel
catalog: Panel
target: viewer panel
summary: The viewer panel type

!! Commands

* ``viewer:back`` — File: go up one level (out of a listing, or to the containing folder)
* ``viewer:focus`` — Viewer: give the keyboard to the text being edited, editing it if it was not
* ``viewer:mute`` — File: mute / unmute
* ``viewer:page`` — File: go to a page of the document
* ``viewer:play`` — File: play one file after another — the checked selection or the query shown (selection / query / stop) [shuffle] [loop]
* ``viewer:play-pause`` — Viewer: play / pause the media, or the animation of a GIF
* ``viewer:reload`` — Viewer: read the text file again, dropping the changes
* ``viewer:restart`` — File: play the media from the start
* ``viewer:save`` — Viewer: write the changes to the text file [force: even over a change made on disk]
* ``viewer:seek`` — File: seek the previewed media by a signed number of seconds
* ``viewer:speed`` — File: step the playback rate
* ``viewer:toggle-edit`` — Viewer: edit the text file shown in the panel, or stop editing it
* ``viewer:toggle-gif-animation`` — File: play or stop the animation of a GIF
* ``viewer:volume`` — File: step the volume
* ``viewer:zoom`` — File: zoom the previewed image/video

!! Generic commands

Provides ``refresh``, ``paths``, ``pasteTarget`` to [[Generic panel commands]].
